# promise: #588
# A player that is a frame of its page (Fandango at Home's player_frame.html) asks for Widevine in
# that frame, not in the page. The request counts for the page (WidevineSignal,
# docs/protected-media.md): the Site Control Center offers the Safari's Engine switch, which it
# never did while only the top frame was asked. frame-player.html's play() adds the frame, on the
# page's own origin as Fandango's is. No network and no account.
# Not covered, and not working in Chromium: a player frame from another site, which runs in
# another process where Cra's page scripts aren't installed (docs/protected-media.md).
# No & in a script: it ends the cra:// query.
budget rss=900 stalls50=40
pace 0.5

# The page itself never asks: nothing is known until its player frame loads.
cra://open?url=${ORIGIN}/frame-player.html?frame=same
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://debug?isolatedJS=['same before',window.__cra.drm===true].join(' ')
expect-log Cra isolatedJS → .*"value":"same before false"
cra://debug?pageJS=play()
expect-log GET /player-frame\.html
wait 2
cra://debug?isolatedJS=['same after',window.__cra.drm===true].join(' ')
expect-log Cra isolatedJS → .*"value":"same after true"
# The frame's own message to its page still arrives, and Cra's never shows there.
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"report()"}
expect-log Cra cdp Runtime.evaluate .*"value":"Framed same, messages ready"

# So the Site Control Center has the switch, and it moves the site to WebKit and back.
cra://debug?siteControls=1
wait 1
cra://debug?siteControlsRead=1
expect-log site controls settings: .*Safari’s Engine, Off
cra://debug?siteControlsPress=Safari’s Engine, Off
expect-log moves to WebKit for 127\.0\.0\.1, as chosen
wait 2
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"[document.title,'userAgentData' in navigator].join()"}
expect-log Cra cdp Runtime.evaluate .*"value":"Framed same,false"
cra://debug?safariEngine=off
expect-log moves to Chromium for 127\.0\.0\.1, as chosen
wait 2
cra://debug?checkStore=1
